    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to Object Wars! The fast-paced, miniature third-person shooter for you and your friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936800/extras/cadbd8fca167f73042a591b40bb30bb5.avif?t=1750944119\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When everyday objects come to life, battle begins! <strong>Dash, fly, and surprise your enemies</strong>: vertical maps and high-octane gameplay thrust you into controlled chaos, where every player can define their style with a diverse and unexpected arsenal. Dive solo or team up for miniature battles, explore different maps, and prove you're the most formidable object in this tiny universe!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Traverse Maps Built for Verticality and Speed</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936800/extras/d5169f3fd523dc4f20aec4c4cba1f763.poster.avif?t=1750944119\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936800/extras/d5169f3fd523dc4f20aec4c4cba1f763.webm?t=1750944119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936800/extras/d5169f3fd523dc4f20aec4c4cba1f763.mp4?t=1750944119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the <strong>air thruster</strong> to propel yourself upwards or sideways to surprise opponents or gain the high ground. Utilize the <strong>grappling hook</strong> for quick repositioning, no matter the situation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize Your Character from Head to Toe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936800/extras/30ef9bcbf6be037b5c5f85ce58ce9066.poster.avif?t=1750944119\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936800/extras/30ef9bcbf6be037b5c5f85ce58ce9066.webm?t=1750944119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936800/extras/30ef9bcbf6be037b5c5f85ce58ce9066.mp4?t=1750944119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change the <strong>object you embody</strong>, its legs, arms, add a hat, backpack, glasses, or even a mustache! Bring your player to life with <strong>over a million possibilities</strong> and many new additions coming soon for even more choices!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft Your Weapons!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield <strong>miniature weapons</strong>, crafted from everyday objects: pencils, erasers, springs, and more! Every part of your weapon is <strong>customizable</strong>. Attach a <strong>secondary barrel</strong> to launch grenades or a tactical grappling hook. You can even <strong>merge the effects of your modifications</strong> to define your strategy, create the ultimate weapon, and dominate the match!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Climb to the Top of the Leaderboards in Ranked Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Object Wars</strong> features precise, fast-paced gameplay with a wide variety of weapon enhancements. Play in different competitive game modes and <strong>climb the ranks</strong> in the global leaderboard!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solo or with Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to fight solo against everyone or create your own squad of living objects? Join various <strong>massively multiplayer game modes</strong> with up to 100 players simultaneously!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enjoy Seasonal Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The adventure in <strong>Object Wars</strong> never stops! Season after season, the universe and its story expand with <strong>redesigned maps, an ever-crazier arsenal of weapons, and new objects</strong>. Every season is an invitation to rediscover the game in a new light! To top it all off, <strong>seasonal events</strong> like Halloween or winter holidays transform environments and add unique modes and objects.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to Object Wars! The fast-paced, miniature third-person shooter for you and your friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936800/extras/cadbd8fca167f73042a591b40bb30bb5.avif?t=1750944119\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When everyday objects come to life, battle begins! <strong>Dash, fly, and surprise your enemies</strong>: vertical maps and high-octane gameplay thrust you into controlled chaos, where every player can define their style with a diverse and unexpected arsenal. Dive solo or team up for miniature battles, explore different maps, and prove you're the most formidable object in this tiny universe!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Traverse Maps Built for Verticality and Speed</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936800/extras/d5169f3fd523dc4f20aec4c4cba1f763.poster.avif?t=1750944119\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936800/extras/d5169f3fd523dc4f20aec4c4cba1f763.webm?t=1750944119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936800/extras/d5169f3fd523dc4f20aec4c4cba1f763.mp4?t=1750944119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the <strong>air thruster</strong> to propel yourself upwards or sideways to surprise opponents or gain the high ground. Utilize the <strong>grappling hook</strong> for quick repositioning, no matter the situation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize Your Character from Head to Toe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936800/extras/30ef9bcbf6be037b5c5f85ce58ce9066.poster.avif?t=1750944119\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936800/extras/30ef9bcbf6be037b5c5f85ce58ce9066.webm?t=1750944119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936800/extras/30ef9bcbf6be037b5c5f85ce58ce9066.mp4?t=1750944119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change the <strong>object you embody</strong>, its legs, arms, add a hat, backpack, glasses, or even a mustache! Bring your player to life with <strong>over a million possibilities</strong> and many new additions coming soon for even more choices!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft Your Weapons!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield <strong>miniature weapons</strong>, crafted from everyday objects: pencils, erasers, springs, and more! Every part of your weapon is <strong>customizable</strong>. Attach a <strong>secondary barrel</strong> to launch grenades or a tactical grappling hook. You can even <strong>merge the effects of your modifications</strong> to define your strategy, create the ultimate weapon, and dominate the match!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Climb to the Top of the Leaderboards in Ranked Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Object Wars</strong> features precise, fast-paced gameplay with a wide variety of weapon enhancements. Play in different competitive game modes and <strong>climb the ranks</strong> in the global leaderboard!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solo or with Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to fight solo against everyone or create your own squad of living objects? Join various <strong>massively multiplayer game modes</strong> with up to 100 players simultaneously!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enjoy Seasonal Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The adventure in <strong>Object Wars</strong> never stops! Season after season, the universe and its story expand with <strong>redesigned maps, an ever-crazier arsenal of weapons, and new objects</strong>. Every season is an invitation to rediscover the game in a new light! To top it all off, <strong>seasonal events</strong> like Halloween or winter holidays transform environments and add unique modes and objects.</p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into Object Wars, a fast-paced TPS where everyday objects come to life for crazy miniature battles! Choose your unique object and jump into fun, chaotic, dynamic, and vertical combat across diverse game modes and maps.",
